# Synthetic carriers for the delayed-action handlers no filer reaches (table 0x4d5c98; rl-mpmsg3.md §The last 24
# handlers; src/rl_mpmsg3.c): the county / economy ones. A handler takes no arguments: it reads the record fields the
# dispatcher 0x4472ce copied out — +4 DAT_005158e8, +8 DAT_005158a8, +0xc DAT_005158a4, +0x10 DAT_005158b0,
# +0x14 DAT_005158ac, +0x18 DAT_005158bc, +0x1c DAT_005158b4 (0x5158a4..0x5158bc contiguous; 0x5158b8 is not a field,
# poked back with its own value). mp-labor-p1 at f4770: p1 local (DAT_0057c8cc = 1) on the map, county 8 selected
# (DAT_0057c93c) and owned by p1 (+1 = 0x53f9b5 + 768 c), county 4 owned by 4, county 2 neutral; county 8: tax 0
# (+0x53fa69), wanted 3 (+0x53fb0e), rations 100 (+0x53fb0f), task 4 flag 1 (+0x53fb60); p1's gold 1000 (0x57c018 + 352 p).
scenario mp-labor-p1

